---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
import { emailUrl, phoneUrl, withBase } from '../utils/links';

const email = emailUrl('Terms of use question');
const phone = phoneUrl();
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use" description="The terms for using the InnovaTech World Knowledge Hub.">
  <article class="prose terms">
    <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: 13 November 2026</p>

    <p>
      These terms govern your use of the InnovaTech World Knowledge Hub (the "Site"), operated by
      InnovaTech World, {site.location}. By using the Site you agree to these terms. If you do not
      agree, please do not use the Site.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      InnovaTech World provides practical digital-skills training. The Site hosts course lessons,
      resources, and (for enrolled students) a learning account.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Using the Site</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>You may read the public lessons and resources for your own learning.</li>
      <li>Do not misuse the Site, attempt to break its security, disrupt it, or access data that is not yours.</li>
      <li>You are responsible for anything done under your account.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Student accounts</h2>
    <p>
      Student accounts are for enrolled learners (by invitation, or by signing up where enabled).
      Keep your password secure and don't share your account. You must give accurate information,
      including your real name. We may suspend accounts that break these terms.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Assignments and submissions</h2>
    <p>
      When you submit assignment links, you confirm you have the right to share them. Do not submit
      unlawful, infringing, or harmful content. Your facilitator reviews submissions to give feedback.
    </p>

    <h2>5. No guarantees of jobs or income</h2>
    <p>
      Our training is designed to help you build skills and a portfolio and become job-ready. We do
      <strong>not</strong> promise or guarantee employment, a specific job, or any level of income.
      Your results depend on your effort and other factors outside our control.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      Course content, text, and branding on the Site belong to InnovaTech World unless stated
      otherwise, and are provided for your personal learning. Do not copy, republish, or resell the
      content without permission. Datasets and templates provided for exercises may be used for your
      own learning and portfolio, but not for resale or redistribution.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Third-party links</h2>
    <p>
      The Site links to external resources we don't control. We're not responsible for their content
      or availability, and linking does not mean we endorse them.
    </p>

    <h2>AI assistant (Lulu)</h2>
    <p>
      Lulu is an automated AI assistant, not a human employee or live support agent. Its replies are
      generated from selected published Site information and may be incomplete, inaccurate, or
      outdated. Do not rely on Lulu for legal, financial, medical, account, pricing, or other important
      decisions. Confirm enrolment, current service availability, prices, dates and policies directly
      with InnovaTech through the Contact page. Do not enter passwords, verification codes, payment
      details, student records or other sensitive information. Lulu does not replace professional
      advice or a confirmed response from InnovaTech.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Availability and changes</h2>
    <p>
      We may update, pause, or change the Site and these terms at any time. We'll post the current
      version here. Continuing to use the Site means you accept the updated terms.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Disclaimer and liability</h2>
    <p>
      The Site and its content are provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind,
      express or implied. We do our best to keep lessons accurate and the Site running, but we don't
      guarantee it will always be available, error-free, or fit for a particular purpose. To the fullest
      extent permitted by law, InnovaTech World is not liable for any indirect or consequential loss, or
      loss of data, profit or opportunity, arising from your use of the Site.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      Our <a href={withBase('/privacy/')}>Privacy Policy</a> explains how we handle personal data. By using the
      Site you agree to it.
    </p>

    <h2>11. Governing law</h2>
    <p>
      These terms are governed by the laws of the Federal Republic of Nigeria, and any dispute will be
      subject to the courts of Bayelsa State, Nigeria. We'll always try to resolve concerns with you
      directly first.
    </p>

    <h2>12. Contact</h2>
    {
      email || phone ? (
        <p>
          Questions about these terms?{' '}
          {email && <a href={email}>{site.contact.email}</a>}
          {email && phone && ' · '}
          {phone && <a href={phone}>{site.contact.phone}</a>}
        </p>
      ) : (
        <p><!-- TODO (owner): add a contact in src/config/site.ts -->Contact details will be added here.</p>
      )
    }
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .terms { margin-inline: auto; }
  .terms .muted { color: var(--color-muted); }
</style>
